(e) comply with Section 5.

4.2 No NOTICE file. You are not required to include a separate NOTICE file or
to reproduce a NOTICE file that may accompany the Work. This Section does not
waive any notice requirement in a Third-Party Material license.

4.3 No modification notices. You are not required to mark modified files or
describe changes. You may add Your own copyright notice to Your
modifications.

4.4 Your own terms. You may license Your own original contributions under
other terms, provided those terms do not restrict the rights granted in the
